# Per-package coverage floors, enforced by scripts/coverage.sh in CI.
#
# Ratchet-only: raise a floor when a package earns it, never lower one to make
# a red build green. A package listed here that no longer exists is an error,
# not a skip. That is how a deleted or renamed package gets noticed.
#
# Targets from the plan, applied as each package lands:
#   internal/packwiz  95   it deletes files on player machines
#   internal/mcevents 95   pure parsing, no excuse for a gap
#   internal/bench    90   a silent misparse invalidates every number  [met: 98]

