# change. cmd/wly gained docker.go: a shell-out adapter with no decisions in it,
# added so that the run orchestration could move into internal/bench and be
# tested against a replayed log. The gate got stricter overall - the package
# holding the logic is at 98 - while the package holding the I/O got thinner and
# less coverable. That is the trade being recorded, not a red build made green.
